My favorite public charging stations are at restaurants, so I have a place to eat and relax while my vehicle is charging. On this trip, I stopped at several Cracker Barrel restaurants in Tennessee and a Makuto's[ Japanese] restaurant in Boone,[ North] Carolina.
Car dealers[hips] will let motorcycles charge, although not always electric cars of another make. Nissan in particular has out[fitted] their dealers[hips] with 240-Volt L[vel] 2 chargers, and more recently, some of them now have high-powered CHAde[MO] DC[ fast] chargers.
